@ P-Acorn. The Acorn item's grant (0x604695B0) starts with `push {r4, lr}`,
@ position-independent, so the trampoline can replay it.

PAcorn_acornGrant:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x004695B0
    symbol:     ModBase::pAcorn::acornGrant(void*)
    trampoline: ModBase::pAcorn::acornGrant_orig(void*)
